# =====================================================================
# ApexBooking monorepo — merged .gitignore
# Covers: repo root, src/backend-api/ (.NET), client-app/ (React + Vite)
# =====================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# .NET build results (unanchored — applies under src/backend-api/**)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# Visual Studio 2015/2017 cache/options directory
.vs/

# User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# NOTE: deliberately no bare `*.sln` pattern here — that pattern in the old
# frontend .gitignore would have ignored the tracked ApexBooking.sln at the
# new repo root. Editor-generated solution/project junk is covered by the
# more specific patterns below instead.
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj

# Mono auto generated files
mono_crash.*

# Build results of an ATL Project
[Dd]ebugPS/
[Rr]eleasePS/
dlldata.c

# .NET Core
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

# ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — NEVER COMMIT THESE! (recursive globs cover both
# src/backend-api/**/appsettings.*.json and client-app/.env*)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
**/secrets.json
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Production.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend — Node / Vite / React (client-app/), plus generated SPA
# output wherever it lands
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
*.local
.superpowers/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Playwright (client-app/e2e)
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
client-app/playwright/.cache/

# The built SPA copied into the backend's web root (see §8 of the
# consolidation — reproducible via `npm run build:wwwroot`, not committed)
src/backend-api/ApexBooking.WebApi/wwwroot/

publish/
.angular
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.next/
.nuxt/
.vuepress/dist/
.serverless/
.fusebox/
.dynamodb/
.tern-port/
.vscode-test/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / IDE
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Claude Code working files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
memory.md
notification_current_status.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Temporary files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*.swp
*.swo
*~
